\">2 options</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Options Sets</b></p><a name=\"opt-item.staffing-level\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for staffing-level </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">RN/MA + MD</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">RN champion + PharmD</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Multidisciplinary team (RN, PharmD, social worker, CHW)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.chw-program\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for chw-program </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">No CHW program documented</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">High-risk patients only</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Full integration across all HF patients</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.monitoring-tech\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for monitoring-tech </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Analog only (telephone, paper diary)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Dual-track (analog and digital available based on patient)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Digital primary plus remote patient monitoring (RPM)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.financial-navigation\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for financial-navigation </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Generic Bridge pathway only (low-cost generics)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Patient assistance program (PAP) pursuit plus Generic Bridge</li></ul></div>"
